# QCar fusion comparison

Split `validate`: 237 frames from {'qcar_coop_07': 118, 'qcar_coop_08': 119}; 10-frame blocks -> 24 independent blocks; 1000 paired block-bootstrap resamples (seed 0). 95% intervals in brackets.

Caveat: validate also selected each run's best epoch (shared mild optimism); no independent test trajectory exists yet.

